t;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Advent Weighs Takeover Of Testing Firm Bureau Veritas&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/advent-weighs-takeover-of-testing-firm-bureau-veritas</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 19:58:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等3家] 随着英伟达的复苏消退，纳斯达克下跌 2%，Anthropic 打破 IPO 价格：实时更新</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</link><description>美国股市周二下跌，回吐了前一交易日因黄仁勋重新担任英伟达首席执行官而引发的部分大幅上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 3 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html'&gt;随着英伟达的复苏消退，纳斯达克下跌 2%，Anthropic 打破 IPO 价格：实时更新&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq drops 2% as Nvidia’s comeback fades, Anthropic breaks IPO price: Live updates&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/c0cb932a-076e-4471-8009-91749fde5f47?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;随着科技股涨势消退，Anthropic 跌破 IPO 价格&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Anthropic falls below IPO price as tech rally fades&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/us-tech-stocks-poised-to-slide-as-ai-caution-returns-after-rally'&gt;英伟达兴奋消退、新关税浮出水面，纳斯达克 100 指数暴跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nasdaq 100 Tumbles as Nvidia Euphoria Fades, New Tariffs Floated&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:02:10 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 专栏：特朗普对英伟达董事会的干预让国家安全付出了代价。我们的对手会注意到</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-national-security-china-chips.html</link><description>特朗普总统决定迫使英伟达董事会重新任命黄仁勋担任首席执行官，这正是北京、德黑兰和莫斯科希望看到的。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-national-security-china-chips.html'&gt;专栏：特朗普对英伟达董事会的干预让国家安全付出了代价。我们的对手会注意到&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Op-ed: Trump’s Nvidia board intervention put a price on national security. Our adversaries will take note&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/trump-nvidia-jensen-huang-national-security-china-chips.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:02:49 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC等4家] 黄仁勋告诉员工，英伟达不需要继任计划</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-employee-meeting.html</link><description>英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋因多起婚外情报道而辞职，其中包括与一名被指控为北京间谍的中国女商人的婚外情。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 4 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-employee-meeting.html'&gt;黄仁勋告诉员工，英伟达不需要继任计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang tells staff that Nvidia doesn't need a succession plan&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/cd1831d0-c3f1-4705-b8e2-badfb5e39764?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;黄仁勋表示他仍然不相信英伟达的继任计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Huang says he still doesn’t believe in Nvidia succession planning&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/technology/jensen-huang-apology-nvidia-ceo.html'&gt;黄仁勋向 Nvidia 员工道歉并表示正在接受治疗&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jensen Huang Apologizes to Nvidia Employees, Says He Is in Therapy&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[美联社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNbUdPNnFZNXVRRHJqeGNYX0ptRk1oUW85OHlueHM2aW5teGxVWmViTWdKOGVTTVBYdWNVTjA3M2d4NUFfQ1Fac2g2ZzVZZ0hMdnZ6V1RQdFRmdWNfZlFzNnRYNmR0YWsxUjFIaTNYR2c5V3RQUHdVVUx4X1loaHF6dEcyNF9fQQ?oc=5'&gt;英伟达董事会在拒绝黄仁勋回归首席执行官几天后恢复其首席执行官职务&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia board reinstates Jensen Huang as CEO just days after rejecting his offer to return&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/jensen-huang-nvidia-employee-meeting.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:04:31 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>